            <RURComments xml:space="preserve">
                <airSeal>During the walkthrough, we found leakage on the following items:



-Doors (Solarium, Living room,)

-Cracks between the wood logs

-Windows 

-Woodstove chimney

-Crawl space

-Basement

-Wood furnace

During the infiltration test walkthrough, we notice air leakage on the items listed above. The old section is leakier than the new section. The infiltrations test result has shown a high level of air leakage. Works to seal the building are strongly recommended.

</airSeal>
                <windows>At the moment of the inspection, we noticed that most of the windows in the old section of the main floor leaks. We recommend the replacement of all original windows by triple panes ENERGY STAR CERTIFIED product and suitable for the northern climate and Canada Zone 3. </windows>
                <doors>We noticed air leakage coming from all the doors. We recommend the replacement of the units by ENERGY STAR CERTIFIED product.</doors>
            </RURComments>
        </Options>
